## Project Conventions

- **Tech Stack**: Next.js 15 (App Router), React 19, TypeScript 5, Bun
- **Run commands**: use Bun
  - `bun run dev`, `bun run build`, `bun run start`
- **Directory layout**:
  - `app/`: Next App Router routes and components
  - `app/components/`: React components
  - `lib/`: Utility functions and data fetching
  - `indexers/`: GitHub Actions automation scripts
  - `backend/`: Rust API server

### TypeScript & React

- **Strict mode**: keep `tsconfig` strict; no `any` unless absolutely necessary
- **ESM only**: use modern ESM imports; no CommonJS
- **Naming**: descriptive, self-explanatory names; avoid 1–2 char identifiers
- **Components**: server components by default; add `"use client"` only when needed
- **Control flow**: prefer early returns; avoid unnecessary try/catch

### Data Fetching

- Use server components for all data fetching
- All pages use ISR with `revalidate = 3600`
- Data comes from Supabase via `lib/jars.ts` functions
- No client-side data fetching for SEO pages

### Styling

- Tailwind CSS for all styling
- CSS variables for theming (defined in `globals.css`)
- Dark mode support via `prefers-color-scheme`
- Use `cx()` utility for conditional classes

### SEO Requirements

- Every page must have:
  - Unique, keyword-rich title
  - Meta description matching search intent
  - Canonical URL
  - JSON-LD structured data
  - Proper heading hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)
- Include internal links to related pages
- Display "Last updated" for freshness signals

### URL Structure

```
/                           # Homepage - all projects
/paper                      # Project page - all Paper versions
/paper/1.21.4               # Version page - all builds for Paper 1.21.4
/paper/1.21.4/123           # Build page - specific build (optional)
/paper/latest               # Redirect to latest download
/paper/1.21.4/latest        # Redirect to latest build for version
```

### Database Conventions

- Use UUIDs for primary keys
- Timestamps use `TIMESTAMPTZ`
- Always include `created_at` and `updated_at`
- Use snake_case for table/column names
- Prefix tables with domain: `jar_projects`, `jar_builds`

### Indexer Conventions

- Each indexer is a standalone TypeScript file
- Use shared `lib/supabase.ts` for database operations
- Always create sync logs for tracking
- Handle errors gracefully and log them
- Rate limit API calls to be respectful

### Build & Validation

- Builds must pass `bun run build`
- TypeScript must compile cleanly
- Backend: `cargo build --release`
- Test locally before deploying
